  "title": "线索转化操作说明",
  "sourceSnapshotId": "snapshot:deb223a3fc9a3f5c",
  "sourceCommits": {
    "frontend": "b38dfdc1351b7f323219cf710fa8d8b807458f2c",
    "backend": "8473d3ee6fcf87b0f351341a875b3d36ebc51ba6"
  },
  "summary": {
    "text": "将状态为待处理或跟进中的线索转化为客户，并可选择同时创建关联项目。系统最终回写线索状态并保存转换记录。",
    "evidenceIds": ["evidence:e4f34abb801a53c4", "evidence:943d5baff5213990", "evidence:8a684ea3f657dd98", "evidence:08a9491dceec9cd6"],
    "confidence": "verified"
  },
  "roles": [],
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "text": "线索状态必须为 pending 或 following。",
      "evidenceIds": ["evidence:e4f34abb801a53c4"],
      "confidence": "verified"
    },
    {
      "text": "必须先关联已有客户或创建客户；创建项目是可选步骤。",
      "evidenceIds": ["evidence:11aaac1e227c2544", "evidence:d36967921537fbf3"],
      "confidence": "verified"
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "document:3630d309ee5f90cf:step:1",
      "title": "处理客户",
      "instruction": {
        "text": "在线索转化向导中关联已有客户或创建客户。系统必须取得客户 ID，否则立即停止并提示重新选择客户。",
        "evidenceIds": ["evidence:54acebb6c62e9c6b", "evidence:181e3142bc3b832f", "evidence:11aaac1e227c2544"],
        "confidence": "verified"
      },
      "screenshots": []
    },
    {
      "id": "document:3630d309ee5f90cf:step:2",
      "title": "选择是否创建项目",
      "instruction": {
        "text": "如需创建项目，进入项目步骤填写并提交；如不需要，选择跳过项目，仅转客户。",
        "evidenceIds": ["evidence:d36967921537fbf3", "evidence:10c5f5e7d8228d40"],
        "confidence": "verified"
      },
      "screenshots": []
    },
    {
      "id": "document:3630d309ee5f90cf:step:3",
      "title": "完成线索转化",
      "instruction": {
        "text": "系统将线索状态更新为 converted，再写入包含线索、客户和可选项目标识的转换记录。只有转换记录返回 200 或 S00000 后才提示转换成功并关闭向导。",
        "evidenceIds": ["evidence:943d5baff5213990", "evidence:8a684ea3f657dd98", "evidence:08a9491dceec9cd6", "evidence:b9850a27f25b9c07"],
        "confidence": "verified"
      },
      "screenshots": []
    }
  ],
  "fields": [],
  "outcomes": [
    {
      "text": "线索状态更新为 converted，并新增一条关联线索、客户及可选项目的转换记录。",
      "evidenceIds": ["evidence:943d5baff5213990", "evidence:08a9491dceec9cd6"],
      "confidence": "verified"
    }
  ],
  "notices": [
    {
      "text": "关联已有客户时，lookupLead 更新失败不会阻断主转换流程。",
      "evidenceIds": ["evidence:54acebb6c62e9c6b", "evidence:181e3142bc3b832f"],
      "confidence": "verified"
    },
    {
      "text": "项目创建失败时客户可能已处理完成，页面停留在项目步骤，可稍后手工补建项目。",
      "evidenceIds": ["evidence:10c5f5e7d8228d40", "evidence:80d4c8562fd3e138"],
      "confidence": "verified"
    },
    {
      "text": "线索状态或转换记录更新失败时不显示转换成功，需要重试。",
      "evidenceIds": ["evidence:8a684ea3f657dd98", "evidence:b9850a27f25b9c07", "evidence:80d4c8562fd3e138"],
      "confidence": "verified"
    }
